# all distinct real roots of polynomial ʟPA (ascending, leading coef<>0)
# -> ʟRT={count,root1,root2,...} ascending.
# Method: roots of p^(k) come from the roots of p^(k+1): p^(k) is
# monotone between them, so each piece is bisected (guaranteed).
dim(ʟPA)-1→N
{0}→ʟRT
If N=1
{1,⁻ʟPA(1)/ʟPA(2)}→ʟRT
If N≥2
Then
1+max(abs(seq(ʟPA(I)/ʟPA(N+1),I,1,N)))→Z
{1,⁻ʟPA(N)/(N*ʟPA(N+1))}→ʟRT
For(M,N-2,0,⁻1)
seq(ʟPA(I+M)*(I+M-1)!/(I-1)!,I,1,N+1-M)→ʟRC
If ʟRT(1)=0
Then
{⁻Z,Z}→ʟRA
Else
augment(augment({⁻Z},seq(ʟRT(I),I,2,ʟRT(1)+1)),{Z})→ʟRA
End
dim(ʟRA)→J
seq(0,I,1,J)→ʟRV
ʟRV→ʟRS
For(I,1,J)
ʟRA(I)→X
0→T
0→E
For(θ,dim(ʟRC),1,⁻1)
T*X+ʟRC(θ)→T
E*abs(X)+abs(ʟRC(θ))→E
End
T→ʟRV(I)
E+1ᴇ⁻3*max(abs(ʟRC))→ʟRS(I)
End
{0}→ʟRN
For(I,1,J-1)
If I>1 and abs(ʟRV(I))≤1ᴇ⁻9*ʟRS(I)
Then
ʟRN(1)+1→ʟRN(1)
ʟRA(I)→ʟRN(ʟRN(1)+1)
Else
If ʟRV(I)*ʟRV(I+1)<0 and abs(ʟRV(I+1))>1ᴇ⁻9*ʟRS(I+1)
Then
ʟRA(I)→A
ʟRA(I+1)→B
For(F,1,45)
(A+B)/2→X
0→T
For(θ,dim(ʟRC),1,⁻1)
T*X+ʟRC(θ)→T
End
If T*ʟRV(I)>0
Then
X→A
Else
X→B
End
End
ʟRN(1)+1→ʟRN(1)
(A+B)/2→ʟRN(ʟRN(1)+1)
End
End
End
ʟRN→ʟRT
End
End
